WEBVTT

00:00:00.553 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:03.550
Your salon is ready to take bookings online.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:06.990
Now it's time to put your booking link everywhere customers might see it:

00:00:07.098 --> 00:00:10.910
Facebook, Instagram, Google, and your own website too.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:12.607
Open Settings.

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:15.487
Right at the top is your salon's Public booking page.

00:00:15.801 --> 00:00:20.046
Tap the copy icon to copy the link, then paste it on your Facebook page,

00:00:19.996 --> 00:00:21.327
in your Instagram bio,

00:00:21.513 --> 00:00:23.647
or send it straight to customers in a message.

00:00:24.293 --> 00:00:28.375
Tap the QR icon next to it to download your salon's QR code.

00:00:28.724 --> 00:00:32.294
Print it on business cards and flyers, or put it on the counter.

00:00:32.402 --> 00:00:36.775
And the button View page shows your salon's page exactly as customers see it.

00:00:37.364 --> 00:00:41.094
If you have your own website, scroll down to Website and booking widget.

00:00:41.265 --> 00:00:44.054
Tap Copy link to put it behind a button on your site.

00:00:44.404 --> 00:00:48.614
Or tap Get embed code, and paste that code into your website:

00:00:48.921 --> 00:00:51.414
customers can then book right on your own page.

00:00:52.034 --> 00:00:52.955
One more tip:

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:55.938
the Overview page also has a button Copy booking link,

00:00:55.888 --> 00:00:57.915
handy when you need to send it quickly.

00:00:58.264 --> 00:01:01.995
The more places your link appears, the easier it is for customers to book.

00:01:02.263 --> 00:01:03.435
Now take the quiz below.
